---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Re-hash every plugin against its pin and update rustman.lock; exits 2 on a mismatch

Usage: rustman plugin verify [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --allow-local-sources
          Also download URL sources that name this machine or a private network (localhost, 10.0.0.5), which a committed source may not reach otherwise; use it only for sources you trust

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
